msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_CHAISE.1"
msgid "Save me the fancy chaise. I'll sit down as soon as I'm done here."
msgstr "花式躺椅给我留着。我忙完就来坐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_CHAISE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_CHAISE.2"
