msgstr "把双重转灯往这边照一点。这样好多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_LAMP_2UPTURNS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_LAMP_2UPTURNS.2"
msgid "If the dual upturn lamp is for reading, it can wait till tomorrow."
msgstr "要是双重转灯是用来看书的，那就明天再开吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_LAMP_ADJUSTABLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_LAMP_ADJUSTABLE.1"
msgid "Leave the adjustable lamp on till I find my shoes."
msgstr "等我找到鞋再关可调整灯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_LAMP_ADJUSTABLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_LAMP_ADJUSTABLE.2"
