msgid "I spent long enough staring at the wood paneling. Let's pick something and finish the room."
msgstr "我盯着木板墙已经够久了。挑好就动手把房间弄完吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IRON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IRON.1"
msgid "Sort the iron ore out from the rest of the pile for me, will you?"
msgstr "能帮我把铁矿石从这堆东西里挑出来吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IRON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IRON.2"
msgid "I should make space in my bag for the iron ore."
msgstr "我应该在包里给铁矿石腾点位置。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IRON_DOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IRON_DOOR.1"
msgid "Leave the wrought iron door shut if you go out. I'm trying to keep it quiet in here."
msgstr "出去时把铁艺门关上。我想让这里安静一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IRON_DOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IRON_DOOR.2"
msgid "I keep forgetting which way the wrought iron door opens."
msgstr "我总记不住铁艺门朝哪边开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYBUG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYBUG.1"
msgid "Look, a bean bugs. Try not to scare it off."
msgstr "看，有豆虫。别把它吓跑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYBUG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYBUG.2"
msgid "I'll leave the bean bugs alone if it leaves me alone."
msgstr "只要豆虫不来打扰我，我也不去打扰它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYBUG_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYBUG_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'll try the cooked bean bugs. Save me a bite."
msgstr "熟豆虫我想试试。给我留一口。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYBUG_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYBUG_COOKED.2"
msgid "Now that there's cooked bean bugs, can we stop for lunch?"
msgstr "既然有熟豆虫了，能停下来吃饭吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KEY_TO_CITY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KEY_TO_CITY.1"
msgid "I've got the key to the City. Which lock takes it?"
msgstr "城镇之钥拿到了。它能开什么锁？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KEY_TO_CITY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KEY_TO_CITY.2"
msgid "One key to the City. I hope finding the lock takes less time."
msgstr "城镇之钥到手。希望找锁能快一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER.DEAD.1"
msgid "The kingfisher hasn't moved since we got here. I think we're fine."
msgstr "从我们过来到现在，翠鸟没动过。应该没事了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER.DEAD.2"
msgid "The kingfisher won't be getting up again. Let's move on."
msgstr "翠鸟不会再起来了。走吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "That kingfisher is hard to keep track of."
msgstr "一转眼就找不到那只翠鸟了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Look, a kingfisher. Try not to scare it off."
msgstr "看，有翠鸟。别把它吓跑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Even the kingfisher found time to sleep. I should take notes."
msgstr "连翠鸟都能抽空睡觉。我该学学。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "The kingfisher gets a nap in the middle of the day. Lucky."
msgstr "翠鸟白天还能睡一觉。真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAPOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAPOOL.1"
msgid "I saw the lava pool. Let me get a little farther away first."
msgstr "我看见岩浆池了。先让我退远点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAPOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAPOOL.2"
msgid "How much room do we have to go around the lava pool?"
msgstr "绕开岩浆池还剩多少地方可走？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.BURNING.1"
msgid "That's smoke coming off the lawn decoration. Back up a little."
msgstr "是草坪装饰在冒烟。往后退一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.BURNING.2"
msgid "The lawn decoration caught fire. Somebody get water!"
msgstr "草坪装饰着火了！谁去拿点水！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.BURNT.1"
msgid "The lawn decoration is pretty much ash now. Leave it to cool."
msgstr "草坪装饰烧得差不多只剩灰了。等它凉了再说。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.BURNT.2"
msgid "So much for the lawn decoration. Is anything under the ash still good?"
msgstr "草坪装饰算是完了。灰底下还有能用的东西吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'm looking at the lawn decoration. That's all I'm doing. Relax."
msgstr "我就看看草坪装饰。不会乱碰，放心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Can we set the lawn decoration down somewhere it won't get knocked over?"
msgstr "能把草坪装饰放在碰不倒的地方吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIFEPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIFEPLANT.1"
msgid "There's some magic flower growing here. Watch where you step."
msgstr "这里长着魔力花。走路当心脚下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIFEPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIFEPLANT.2"
msgid "I wonder what the magic flower looks like after a good rain."
msgstr "不知道下场雨以后，魔力花会长成什么样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LILYPAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LILYPAD.1"
msgid "I'll leave the lily pad alone today. It can keep growing."
msgstr "今天先不动睡莲叶。让它接着长吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LILYPAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LILYPAD.2"
msgid "There's some lily pad growing here. Watch where you step."
msgstr "这里长着睡莲叶。走路当心脚下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVING_ARTIFACT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVING_ARTIFACT.1"
msgid "It moved before I even touched it."
msgstr "我还没碰它，它就动了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVING_ARTIFACT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVING_ARTIFACT.2"
msgid "It's doing something on its own. That's a little too alive for me."
msgstr "它自己在动。活过头了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOTUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOTUS.1"
msgid "I wonder what the lotus plant looks like after a good rain."
msgstr "不知道下场雨以后，睡莲会长成什么样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOTUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOTUS.2"
msgid "I'll leave the lotus plant alone today. It can keep growing."
msgstr "今天先不动睡莲。让它接着长吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOTUS_FLOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOTUS_FLOWER.1"
msgid "Hand me the lotus flower. I haven't eaten since we left."
msgstr "把睡莲花递给我。出门以后我还没吃过东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOTUS_FLOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOTUS_FLOWER.2"
msgid "I had plans. Then somebody made lotus flower."
msgstr "我原本还有事要做。现在有人做了睡莲花。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOTUS_FLOWER_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOTUS_FLOWER_COOKED.1"
msgid "Hand me the cooked lotus root. I haven't eaten since we left."
msgstr "把熟莲藕递给我。出门以后我还没吃过东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOTUS_FLOWER_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOTUS_FLOWER_COOKED.2"
msgid "I had plans. Then somebody made cooked lotus root."
msgstr "我原本还有事要做。现在有人做了熟莲藕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MACHETE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MACHETE.1"
msgid "If you borrow my machete, put it back where you found it."
msgstr "借我的砍刀可以，用完放回原处。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MACHETE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MACHETE.2"
msgid "Anybody using the machete? I could use a turn."
msgstr "有人在用砍刀吗？我正想用一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGNIFYING_GLASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGNIFYING_GLASS.1"
msgid "I'll be careful with the magnifying glass. Stop looking at me like that."
msgstr "我会小心用放大镜。别那样看我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGNIFYING_GLASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGNIFYING_GLASS.2"
msgid "I'll take the magnifying glass with me. Better than walking back for it."
msgstr "我把放大镜带上吧，省得走一半还得回来拿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKEHOUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKEHOUSE.1"
msgid "I could wait by the mandrake hill, if we're stopping here."
msgstr "如果要在这里停一会儿，我可以在曼德拉丘旁边等。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKEHOUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKEHOUSE.2"
msgid "I can see the mandrake hill from here. Want to go look?"
msgstr "从这里能看见曼德拉丘。要过去看看吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKEMAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKEMAN.1"
msgid "I was having a quiet day till that elder mandrake showed up."
msgstr "那只曼德拉长者来之前，我过得还挺清静。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKEMAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKEMAN.2"
msgid "Hey, elder mandrake. You don't have to come any closer."
msgstr "喂，曼德拉长者。你待在那边就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP.DEAD.1"
msgid "I think the snaptooth seedling is done. I'm still not putting my hand near it."
msgstr "利齿幼苗应该已经死了。我还是不把手伸过去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP.DEAD.2"
msgid "The snaptooth seedling won't be getting up again. Let's move on."
msgstr "利齿幼苗不会再起来了。走吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP.GENERIC.1"
msgid "That's a snaptooth seedling. Stay over there, thanks."
msgstr "是利齿幼苗。麻烦待在那边。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Leave some room between us and that snaptooth seedling."
msgstr "和那只利齿幼苗保持点距离。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Don't wake the snaptooth seedling. We'll be gone in a minute."
msgstr "别吵醒利齿幼苗。我们一会儿就走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "The snaptooth seedling gets a nap in the middle of the day. Lucky."
msgstr "利齿幼苗白天还能睡一觉。真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATED_NETTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATED_NETTLE.1"
msgid "I had plans. Then somebody made meated nettles."
msgstr "我原本还有事要做。现在有人做了肉夹荨麻。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATED_NETTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATED_NETTLE.2"
msgid "Hand me the meated nettles. I haven't eaten since we left."
msgstr "把肉夹荨麻递给我。出门以后我还没吃过东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.METALPLATEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.METALPLATEHAT.1"
msgid "The fancy helmet can go on the hook when I get home."
msgstr "回家以后，花哨的头盔可以挂到钩子上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.METALPLATEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.METALPLATEHAT.2"
msgid "I'll try the fancy helmet on. Does it flatten my hair?"
msgstr "我戴一下花哨的头盔。会把头发压扁吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NECTAR_POD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NECTAR_POD.1"
msgid "If we have any more nectar, put it with this batch."
msgstr "还有花蜜的话，就放到这堆一起。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NECTAR_POD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NECTAR_POD.2"
msgid "I'll carry the nectar if somebody else carries the rest."
msgstr "其他东西谁拿一下，花蜜我来带。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.DEFAULT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.DEFAULT.1"
msgid "I'll leave the nettle vine alone today. It can keep growing."
msgstr "今天先不动荨麻藤。让它接着长吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.DEFAULT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.DEFAULT.2"
msgid "I wonder what the nettle vine looks like after a good rain."
msgstr "不知道下场雨以后，荨麻藤会长成什么样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Nothing left to pick. I hope my nose can wait."
msgstr "已经摘光了。希望我的鼻子等得起。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I took the last leaves. Leave the plant alone for a while."
msgstr "最后几片叶子我摘了。先留它长一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.MOIST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.MOIST.1"
msgid "The leaves look better after a little water. So does my nose, once I get some."
msgstr "浇点水，叶子就精神了。等我有荨麻用，鼻子也能舒服些。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.MOIST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.MOIST.2"
msgid "Keep the dirt like this. I want the nettles to last through the next sneeze."
msgstr "土就保持这样。下次打喷嚏我还要用荨麻。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.WITHERED.1"
msgid "Something's wrong with the nettle vine. It wasn't this droopy before."
msgstr "荨麻藤不对劲。之前没这么蔫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.WITHERED.2"
msgid "I'll leave the nettle vine alone till we know how to help it."
msgstr "先别动荨麻藤。等弄清怎么救它再说。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLELOSANGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLELOSANGE.1"
msgid "I had plans. Then somebody made nettle rolls."
msgstr "我原本还有事要做。现在有人做了荨麻卷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLELOSANGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NETTLELOSANGE.2"
msgid "Put the nettle rolls where I can reach it. I'll be hungry later."
msgstr "荨麻卷放在我够得着的地方。晚点我会饿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN.1"
msgid "Keep that obsidian. I might need it later."
msgstr "黑曜石先留着。晚点我可能用得上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN.2"
msgid "Sort the obsidian out from the rest of the pile for me, will you?"
msgstr "能帮我把黑曜石从这堆东西里挑出来吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC.1"
msgid "I've got oinc. Is that enough for lunch?"
msgstr "我有呼噜币。够买午饭了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC.2"
msgid "Keep the oinc somewhere it won't get lifted."
msgstr "把呼噜币放到不会被偷走的地方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC10.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC10.1"
msgid "Keep the tenpiece oinc somewhere it won't get lifted."
msgstr "把十元呼噜币放到不会被偷走的地方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC10.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC10.2"
msgid "I've got tenpiece oinc. Is that enough for lunch?"
msgstr "我有十元呼噜币。够买午饭了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC100.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC100.1"
msgid "With centapiece oinc in my pocket, I can at least go look in the shops."
msgstr "兜里有百元呼噜币了，至少能去店里看看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC100.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC100.2"
msgid "Keep the centapiece oinc somewhere it won't get lifted."
msgstr "把百元呼噜币放到不会被偷走的地方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORGANIC_DOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORGANIC_DOOR.1"
msgid "Leave the forest door shut if you go out. I'm trying to keep it quiet in here."
msgstr "出去时把森林门关上。我想让这里安静一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORGANIC_DOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORGANIC_DOOR.2"
msgid "I'll go through the forest door. Tell me if it's the wrong room."
msgstr "我从森林门进去。房间走错了就告诉我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX_FLUTE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX_FLUTE.1"
msgid "If you borrow my dripple pipes, put it back where you found it."
msgstr "借我的降雨排箫可以，用完放回原处。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX_FLUTE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX_FLUTE.2"
msgid "Anybody using the dripple pipes? I could use a turn."
msgstr "有人在用降雨排箫吗？我正想用一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX_HORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX_HORN.1"
msgid "Let me get a feel for the horn before anything comes after us."
msgstr "趁还没东西追过来，让我先试试牛角的手感。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX_HORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX_HORN.2"
msgid "I can take the horn, but I'm bringing my bat too."
msgstr "牛角可以带上，球棒我也要带。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANGOLDEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANGOLDEN.1"
msgid "I'm waiting to see exactly how that gold comes out."
msgstr "我得看看金子到底是怎么出来的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANGOLDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANGOLDEN.2"
msgid "If I had one of those at home, I'd never need pocket money."
msgstr "家里有这么一只，我就不用领零花钱了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.DEAD.1"
msgid "I think the parrot is done. I'm still not putting my hand near it."
msgstr "鹦鹉应该已经死了。我还是不把手伸过去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.DEAD.2"
msgid "The parrot hasn't moved since we got here. I think we're fine."
msgstr "从我们过来到现在，鹦鹉没动过。应该没事了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Look, a parrot. Try not to scare it off."
msgstr "看，有鹦鹉。别把它吓跑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Is that a parrot? Hold still, I want a better look."
msgstr "那是鹦鹉吗？别动，我想看清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Don't wake the parrot. We'll be gone in a minute."
msgstr "别吵醒鹦鹉。我们一会儿就走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Even the parrot found time to sleep. I should take notes."
msgstr "连鹦鹉都能抽空睡觉。我该学学。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK.DEAD.1"
msgid "The peagawk won't be getting up again. Let's move on."
msgstr "呆望雀不会再起来了。走吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK.DEAD.2"
msgid "The peagawk hasn't moved since we got here. I think we're fine."
msgstr "从我们过来到现在，呆望雀没动过。应该没事了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "That peagawk is hard to keep track of."
msgstr "一转眼就找不到那只呆望雀了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Is that a peagawk? Hold still, I want a better look."
msgstr "那是呆望雀吗？别动，我想看清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Even the peagawk found time to sleep. I should take notes."
msgstr "连呆望雀都能抽空睡觉。我该学学。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Don't wake the peagawk. We'll be gone in a minute."
msgstr "别吵醒呆望雀。我们一会儿就走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWKFEATHER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWKFEATHER.1"
msgid "Sort the peagawk plume out from the rest of the pile for me, will you?"
msgstr "能帮我把呆望雀羽毛从这堆东西里挑出来吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWKFEATHER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWKFEATHER.2"
msgid "Keep that peagawk plume. I might need it later."
msgstr "呆望雀羽毛先留着。晚点我可能用得上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK_BUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK_BUSH.1"
msgid "I'll leave the blinkbush alone today. It can keep growing."
msgstr "今天先不动眨眼的灌木丛。让它接着长吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK_BUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK_BUSH.2"
msgid "I wonder what the blinkbush looks like after a good rain."
msgstr "不知道下场雨以后，眨眼的灌木丛会长成什么样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEDESTAL_KEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEDESTAL_KEY.1"
msgid "I'll keep the royal gallery key in my pocket where it won't get lost."
msgstr "皇家画廊钥匙先放兜里，免得弄丢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEDESTAL_KEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEDESTAL_KEY.2"
msgid "I've got the royal gallery key. Which lock takes it?"
msgstr "皇家画廊钥匙拿到了。它能开什么锁？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHEROMONESTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHEROMONESTONE.1"
msgid "If we have any more pherostone, put it with this batch."
msgstr "还有信息素石的话，就放到这堆一起。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHEROMONESTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHEROMONESTONE.2"
msgid "How much pherostone do we have now? I lost count."
msgstr "现在有多少信息素石了？我数乱了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGBANDIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGBANDIT.1"
msgid "Stop! You can drop the money or make me catch up."
msgstr "站住！把钱放下，不然我就追上去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGBANDIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGBANDIT.2"
msgid "That pig's got my oincs. Watch my stuff while I get them back."
msgstr "我的呼噜币在它手里。帮我看着东西，我去拿回来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGCROWNHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGCROWNHAT.1"
msgid "I'll try the royal crown on. Does it flatten my hair?"
msgstr "我戴一下王冠。会把头发压扁吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGCROWNHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGCROWNHAT.2"
msgid "Think the royal crown goes with my uniform? I'm wearing it either way."
msgstr "王冠配我的制服吗？反正我会戴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGEON.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGEON.DEAD.1"
msgid "I think the pigeon is done. I'm still not putting my hand near it."
msgstr "鸽子应该已经死了。我还是不把手伸过去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGEON.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGEON.DEAD.2"
msgid "The pigeon hasn't moved since we got here. I think we're fine."
msgstr "从我们过来到现在，鸽子没动过。应该没事了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGEON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGEON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Look, a pigeon. Try not to scare it off."
msgstr "看，有鸽子。别把它吓跑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGEON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGEON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll leave the pigeon alone if it leaves me alone."
msgstr "只要鸽子不来打扰我，我也不去打扰它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGEON.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGEON.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Don't wake the pigeon. We'll be gone in a minute."
msgstr "别吵醒鸽子。我们一会儿就走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGEON.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGEON.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "The pigeon gets a nap in the middle of the day. Lucky."
msgstr "鸽子白天还能睡一觉。真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGHOST.1"
msgid "I don't know if the bat would go through it. I'd rather keep it that way."
msgstr "我不知道球棒会不会从它身上穿过去。也没兴趣试。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGHOST.2"
msgid "It's a pig. It's floating. I'm going back outside."
msgstr "是头猪。它在飘。我先出去了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_CITY.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_CITY.BURNING.1"
msgid "The town house is on fire. Is everyone out?"
msgstr "城镇房屋着火了。人都出来了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_CITY.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_CITY.BURNING.2"
msgid "Get away from the town house. I'll find water."
msgstr "先离城镇房屋远点。我去找水。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_CITY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_CITY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "If I lose you, meet me by the town house."
msgstr "要是走散了，就在城镇房屋旁边碰面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_CITY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_CITY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I could wait by the town house, if we're stopping here."
msgstr "如果要在这里停一会儿，我可以在城镇房屋旁边等。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM.BURNING.1"
msgid "What about the people inside the farm house? Go check!"
msgstr "农场房屋里的人呢？快确认一下！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM.BURNING.2"
msgid "Get away from the farm house. I'll find water."
msgstr "先离农场房屋远点。我去找水。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "If I lose you, meet me by the farm house."
msgstr "要是走散了，就在农场房屋旁边碰面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "That's the farm house. I wonder if anyone's inside."
msgstr "那是农场房屋。不知道里面有没有人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_MINE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_MINE.BURNING.1"
msgid "What about the people inside the quarry lodgings? Go check!"
msgstr "采石场住所里的人呢？快确认一下！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_MINE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_MINE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Get away from the quarry lodgings. I'll find water."
msgstr "先离采石场住所远点。我去找水。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_MINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_MINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can see the quarry lodgings from here. Want to go look?"
msgstr "从这里能看见采石场住所。要过去看看吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_MINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_MINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I could wait by the quarry lodgings, if we're stopping here."
msgstr "如果要在这里停一会儿，我可以在采石场住所旁边等。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BANKER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BANKER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Hey, can I ask the banker something before we go?"
msgstr "出发前我能问银行家一件事吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BANKER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BANKER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "That's the banker, right? I keep mixing people up around here."
msgstr "那位是银行家吧？这里的人我总认错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BANKER.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BANKER.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Even the banker found time to sleep. I should take notes."
msgstr "连银行家都能抽空睡觉。我该学学。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BANKER.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BANKER.SLEEPING.2"
