msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BEAUTICIAN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "The beautician looks busy. I'll try again later."
msgstr "美容师看着挺忙。我晚点再来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BEAUTICIAN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BEAUTICIAN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "That's the beautician, right? I keep mixing people up around here."
msgstr "那位是美容师吧？这里的人我总认错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BEAUTICIAN.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BEAUTICIAN.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "The beautician gets a nap in the middle of the day. Lucky."
msgstr "美容师白天还能睡一觉。真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BEAUTICIAN.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BEAUTICIAN.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Don't wake the beautician. We'll be gone in a minute."
msgstr "别吵醒美容师。我们一会儿就走。"

