msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_COLLECTOR.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Don't wake the collector. We'll be gone in a minute."
msgstr "别吵醒收藏家。我们一会儿就走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ERUDITE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ERUDITE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "That's the magic shopkeeper, right? I keep mixing people up around here."
msgstr "那位是魔法商店店主吧？这里的人我总认错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ERUDITE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ERUDITE.GENERIC.2"
