#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ERUDITE.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ERUDITE.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Don't wake the magic shopkeeper. We'll be gone in a minute."
msgstr "别吵醒魔法商店店主。我们一会儿就走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ERUDITE.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ERUDITE.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Even the magic shopkeeper found time to sleep. I should take notes."
msgstr "连魔法商店店主都能抽空睡觉。我该学学。"

