msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FARMER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "That's the farmer, right? I keep mixing people up around here."
msgstr "那位是农民吧？这里的人我总认错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FARMER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FARMER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Maybe the farmer can point me in the right direction."
msgstr "农民兴许能给我指个路。"

