msgstr "连农民都能抽空睡觉。我该学学。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FARMER.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FARMER.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "The farmer gets a nap in the middle of the day. Lucky."
msgstr "农民白天还能睡一觉。真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FLORIST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FLORIST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "That's the florist, right? I keep mixing people up around here."
msgstr "那位是花商吧？这里的人我总认错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FLORIST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FLORIST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Maybe the florist can point me in the right direction."
msgstr "花商兴许能给我指个路。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FLORIST.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FLORIST.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Even the florist found time to sleep. I should take notes."
msgstr "连花商都能抽空睡觉。我该学学。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FLORIST.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FLORIST.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Don't wake the florist. We'll be gone in a minute."
msgstr "别吵醒花商。我们一会儿就走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_HATMAKER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_HATMAKER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Hey, can I ask the hatmaker something before we go?"
msgstr "出发前我能问帽店店主一件事吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_HATMAKER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_HATMAKER.GENERIC.2"
