#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_HATMAKER.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_HATMAKER.SLEEPING.1"
