msgstr "从这里能看见角塔房屋套件。要过去看看吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TURRET_CRAFT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TURRET_CRAFT.2"
