msgstr "那是别墅。不知道里面有没有人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_VILLA_CRAFT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_VILLA_CRAFT.1"
msgid "If I lose you, meet me by the villa kit."
msgstr "要是走散了，就在别墅套件旁边碰面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_VILLA_CRAFT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_VILLA_CRAFT.2"
msgid "I could wait by the villa kit, if we're stopping here."
msgstr "如果要在这里停一会儿，我可以在别墅套件旁边等。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POG.APORKALYPSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POG.APORKALYPSE.1"
msgid "Look, a pog. Try not to scare it off."
msgstr "看，有哈巴狸。别把它吓跑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POG.APORKALYPSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POG.APORKALYPSE.2"
msgid "Is that a pog? Hold still, I want a better look."
msgstr "那是哈巴狸吗？别动，我想看清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POG.FOLLOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POG.FOLLOWER.1"
msgid "Look, a pog. Try not to scare it off."
msgstr "看，有哈巴狸。别把它吓跑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POG.FOLLOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POG.FOLLOWER.2"
msgid "I'll leave the pog alone if it leaves me alone."
msgstr "只要哈巴狸不来打扰我，我也不去打扰它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POG.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POG.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Look, a pog. Try not to scare it off."
msgstr "看，有哈巴狸。别把它吓跑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POG.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POG.GENERIC.2"
msgid "That pog is hard to keep track of."
msgstr "一转眼就找不到那只哈巴狸了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POG.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POG.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "The pog gets a nap in the middle of the day. Lucky."
msgstr "哈巴狸白天还能睡一觉。真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POG.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POG.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Don't wake the pog. We'll be gone in a minute."
msgstr "别吵醒哈巴狸。我们一会儿就走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POISONBALM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POISONBALM.1"
msgid "I'll keep the poison balm handy. I never know what I'll step on."
msgstr "毒药膏得随身带着。谁知道我会踩到什么。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POISONBALM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POISONBALM.2"
msgid "Pack the poison balm where we can find it in a hurry."
msgstr "把毒药膏放到急用时找得到的地方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_BALLOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_BALLOON.1"
msgid "Flat on the ground. That's probably where it's staying."
msgstr "都瘪在地上了。大概只能留在这儿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_BALLOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_BALLOON.2"
msgid "So much for flying home. Did we bring shoes for the walk?"
msgstr "别想飞回家了。鞋带了吗？得用走的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_BASKET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_BASKET.1"
msgid "Didn't feel so solid on the way down."
msgstr "掉下来的时候，可没觉得这篮子有多结实。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_BASKET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_BASKET.2"
msgid "Guess this was my seat. I don't think I want another ride."
msgstr "看来这就是我的座位。我不想再坐一次了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_FLAGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_FLAGS.1"
msgid "The flags made it here. I'd have traded them for an extra rope."
msgstr "旗子倒是跟着过来了。换成一根多余的绳子就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_FLAGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_FLAGS.2"
msgid "Too many flags, not enough things that make a balloon fly."
msgstr "旗子太多，能让气球飞起来的东西太少。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_SANDBAG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_SANDBAG.1"
msgid "I should make space in my bag for the bag of Sand."
msgstr "我应该在包里给一大包沙子腾点位置。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_SANDBAG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_SANDBAG.2"
msgid "I'll carry the bag of Sand if somebody else carries the rest."
msgstr "其他东西谁拿一下，一大包沙子我来带。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_SUITCASE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_SUITCASE.1"
msgid "If we have any more monogrammed luggage, put it with this batch."
msgstr "还有有花押字的行李箱的话，就放到这堆一起。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_SUITCASE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_SUITCASE.2"
msgid "How much monogrammed luggage do we have now? I lost count."
msgstr "现在有多少有花押字的行李箱了？我数乱了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_TRUNK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_TRUNK.1"
msgid "Keep that monogrammed luggage. I might need it later."
msgstr "有花押字的行李箱先留着。晚点我可能用得上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_TRUNK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_TRUNK.2"
msgid "Sort the monogrammed luggage out from the rest of the pile for me, will you?"
msgstr "能帮我把有花押字的行李箱从这堆东西里挑出来吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PROP_DOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PROP_DOOR.1"
msgid "I'll go through the door. Tell me if it's the wrong room."
msgstr "我从门进去。房间走错了就告诉我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PROP_DOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PROP_DOOR.2"
msgid "I keep forgetting which way the door opens."
msgstr "我总记不住门朝哪边开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK.1"
msgid "That thing has scales thicker than my bat."
msgstr "那家伙的鳞片比我球棒还厚。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK.2"
msgid "Keep your eyes down. Don't let it catch you staring."
msgstr "低头，别跟它对上眼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_CORPSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_CORPSE.1"
msgid "I should make space in my bag for the petrifying bones."
msgstr "我应该在包里给石化的骨头腾点位置。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_CORPSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_CORPSE.2"
msgid "Keep that petrifying bones. I might need it later."
msgstr "石化的骨头先留着。晚点我可能用得上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_FOUNTAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_FOUNTAIN.1"
msgid "Youth? Ask me again after a few years of school."
msgstr "变年轻？等我再上几年学再问我吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_FOUNTAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_FOUNTAIN.2"
msgid "If it makes me younger, do I have to go back a grade?"
msgstr "要是变年轻了，我是不是还得回去重读一年？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_RUINS_PILLAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_RUINS_PILLAR.1"
msgid "I heard something shift when I leaned on it. Nobody try that again."
msgstr "我一靠上去就听见东西挪了。谁都别再试。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_RUINS_PILLAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_RUINS_PILLAR.2"
msgid "That pillar's already leaning. Walk on the other side."
msgstr "柱子已经歪了。从另一边走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_SKULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_SKULL.1"
msgid "If we have any more pugalisk skull, put it with this batch."
msgstr "还有翘鼻蛇怪头骨的话，就放到这堆一起。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_SKULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_SKULL.2"
msgid "I should make space in my bag for the pugalisk skull."
msgstr "我应该在包里给翘鼻蛇怪头骨腾点位置。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_TRAP_DOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_TRAP_DOOR.1"
msgid "Leave the ominous carving shut if you go out. I'm trying to keep it quiet in here."
msgstr "出去时把不祥的雕刻关上。我想让这里安静一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_TRAP_DOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_TRAP_DOOR.2"
msgid "I'll go through the ominous carving. Tell me if it's the wrong room."
msgstr "我从不祥的雕刻进去。房间走错了就告诉我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABID_BEETLE.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABID_BEETLE.DEAD.1"
msgid "I think the rabid beetle is done. I'm still not putting my hand near it."
msgstr "疯狂甲虫应该已经死了。我还是不把手伸过去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABID_BEETLE.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABID_BEETLE.DEAD.2"
msgid "The rabid beetle won't be getting up again. Let's move on."
msgstr "疯狂甲虫不会再起来了。走吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABID_BEETLE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABID_BEETLE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Leave some room between us and that rabid beetle."
msgstr "和那只疯狂甲虫保持点距离。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABID_BEETLE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABID_BEETLE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Hey, rabid beetle. You don't have to come any closer."
msgstr "喂，疯狂甲虫。你待在那边就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABID_BEETLE.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABID_BEETLE.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Don't wake the rabid beetle. We'll be gone in a minute."
msgstr "别吵醒疯狂甲虫。我们一会儿就走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABID_BEETLE.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABID_BEETLE.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Even the rabid beetle found time to sleep. I should take notes."
msgstr "连疯狂甲虫都能抽空睡觉。我该学学。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RADISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RADISH.1"
msgid "I had plans. Then somebody made radish."
msgstr "我原本还有事要做。现在有人做了水萝卜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RADISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RADISH.2"
msgid "Put the radish where I can reach it. I'll be hungry later."
msgstr "水萝卜放在我够得着的地方。晚点我会饿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RADISH_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RADISH_COOKED.1"
msgid "The cooked radish smells good. I get the first bite, right?"
msgstr "熟水萝卜闻起来不错。我可以吃第一口吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RADISH_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RADISH_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'll try the cooked radish. Save me a bite."
msgstr "熟水萝卜我想试试。给我留一口。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RADISH_PLANTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RADISH_PLANTED.1"
msgid "There's some radish growing here. Watch where you step."
msgstr "这里长着水萝卜。走路当心脚下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RADISH_PLANTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RADISH_PLANTED.2"
msgid "I wonder what the radish looks like after a good rain."
msgstr "不知道下场雨以后，水萝卜会长成什么样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RADISH_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RADISH_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I'll plant the drip seeds. You're in charge of remembering to water it."
msgstr "水滴状种子我来种。记得浇水就交给你了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RADISH_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RADISH_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Somebody mark where we plant the drip seeds. I forget these things."
msgstr "种水滴状种子的地方做个记号。过几天我就忘了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.BURNING.1"
msgid "That's smoke coming off the rainforest tree. Back up a little."
msgstr "是雨林树在冒烟。往后退一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Do we have time to save the rainforest tree? That fire's getting bigger."
msgstr "现在还来得及救雨林树吗？火越来越大了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.BURNT.1"
msgid "The rainforest tree is pretty much ash now. Leave it to cool."
msgstr "雨林树烧得差不多只剩灰了。等它凉了再说。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.BURNT.2"
msgid "So much for the rainforest tree. Is anything under the ash still good?"
msgstr "雨林树算是完了。灰底下还有能用的东西吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "The rainforest tree is cut back. My arms can rest now."
msgstr "雨林树砍完了。胳膊可以歇了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "That's enough chopping for now. What's left of the rainforest tree can stay."
msgstr "先砍到这儿。剩下的雨林树就留着吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll leave the rainforest tree alone today. It can keep growing."
msgstr "今天先不动雨林树。让它接着长吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "If you're taking some rainforest tree, leave a bit for later."
msgstr "要摘雨林树的话，留点下次再来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE_ROT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE_ROT.1"
msgid "I wonder what the sick rainforest tree looks like after a good rain."
msgstr "不知道下场雨以后，生病的雨林树会长成什么样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE_ROT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE_ROT.2"
msgid "There's some sick rainforest tree growing here. Watch where you step."
msgstr "这里长着生病的雨林树。走路当心脚下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECONSTRUCTION_PROJECT.RUBBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECONSTRUCTION_PROJECT.RUBBLE.1"
msgid "There's a lot of the building on the floor. Where do we even start?"
msgstr "房子一大半都散在地上了。从哪儿开始修？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECONSTRUCTION_PROJECT.RUBBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECONSTRUCTION_PROJECT.RUBBLE.2"
msgid "It used to have walls. I can still see where one of them went."
msgstr "原来是有墙的。我还能看出其中一面在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECONSTRUCTION_PROJECT.SCAFFOLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECONSTRUCTION_PROJECT.SCAFFOLD.1"
msgid "The supports are up. I'd still avoid leaning on them."
msgstr "架子搭好了。我还是先别往上靠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECONSTRUCTION_PROJECT.SCAFFOLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECONSTRUCTION_PROJECT.SCAFFOLD.2"
msgid "It looks more like a building every time I walk past."
msgstr "每次经过，这里都更像座房子了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS_WATER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS_WATER.1"
msgid "I'll leave the reeds alone today. It can keep growing."
msgstr "今天先不动芦苇。让它接着长吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS_WATER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS_WATER.2"
msgid "If you're taking some reeds, leave a bit for later."
msgstr "要摘芦苇的话，留点下次再来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_1.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_1.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I want a closer look at the lost idol. Can you watch my back?"
msgstr "我想凑近看看遗失的塑像。帮我留意身后好吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_1.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_1.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Something about the lost idol makes me want to look at the floor before I step."
msgstr "看见遗失的塑像，我就觉得走路前得先看地上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_1.SUNKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_1.SUNKEN.1"
msgid "Let me reach for the lost idol. Hold my sleeve out of the water."
msgstr "我去够遗失的塑像。帮我拉着袖子，别沾水。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_1.SUNKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_1.SUNKEN.2"
msgid "The lost idol is still down there. I know what that means for my shoes."
msgstr "遗失的塑像还在底下。不用想都知道我的鞋会怎样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_2.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_2.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Something about the lost totem makes me want to look at the floor before I step."
msgstr "看见遗失的图腾，我就觉得走路前得先看地上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_2.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_2.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Take a look at the lost totem. Tell me if anything around it moves."
msgstr "看看遗失的图腾。旁边有东西动就告诉我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_2.SUNKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_2.SUNKEN.1"
msgid "The lost totem is still down there. I know what that means for my shoes."
msgstr "遗失的图腾还在底下。不用想都知道我的鞋会怎样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_2.SUNKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_2.SUNKEN.2"
msgid "Let me reach for the lost totem. Hold my sleeve out of the water."
msgstr "我去够遗失的图腾。帮我拉着袖子，别沾水。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_3.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_3.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I think I can see the relic fragment from here. Hold up the light."
msgstr "从这里好像能看到遗迹碎片。把灯举高。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_3.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_3.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Take a look at the relic fragment. Tell me if anything around it moves."
msgstr "看看遗迹碎片。旁边有东西动就告诉我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_3.SUNKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_3.SUNKEN.1"
msgid "Let me reach for the relic fragment. Hold my sleeve out of the water."
msgstr "我去够遗迹碎片。帮我拉着袖子，别沾水。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_3.SUNKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_3.SUNKEN.2"
msgid "I can see the relic fragment down there. I'll need something to fish it out."
msgstr "能看见遗迹碎片在底下。我得找东西把它捞上来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_4.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_4.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Take a look at the blue sow. Tell me if anything around it moves."
msgstr "看看蓝色母猪。旁边有东西动就告诉我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_4.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_4.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I think I can see the blue sow from here. Hold up the light."
msgstr "从这里好像能看到蓝色母猪。把灯举高。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_4.SUNKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_4.SUNKEN.1"
msgid "Let me reach for the blue sow. Hold my sleeve out of the water."
msgstr "我去够蓝色母猪。帮我拉着袖子，别沾水。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_4.SUNKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_4.SUNKEN.2"
msgid "The blue sow is still down there. I know what that means for my shoes."
msgstr "蓝色母猪还在底下。不用想都知道我的鞋会怎样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_5.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_5.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I think I can see the jeweled truffle from here. Hold up the light."
msgstr "从这里好像能看到宝石松露。把灯举高。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_5.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_5.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Take a look at the jeweled truffle. Tell me if anything around it moves."
msgstr "看看宝石松露。旁边有东西动就告诉我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_5.SUNKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_5.SUNKEN.1"
msgid "Let me reach for the jeweled truffle. Hold my sleeve out of the water."
msgstr "我去够宝石松露。帮我拉着袖子，别沾水。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_5.SUNKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC_5.SUNKEN.2"
msgid "I can see the jeweled truffle down there. I'll need something to fish it out."
msgstr "能看见宝石松露在底下。我得找东西把它捞上来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ANTCAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ANTCAVE.1"
msgid "I'll try a couple of swings at the stalagmite and see what comes loose."
msgstr "我先往石笋上敲两下，看看能敲出什么。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ANTCAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ANTCAVE.2"
msgid "That stalagmite looks like a job for a pickaxe."
msgstr "石笋看起来得用镐来敲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_BASALT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_BASALT.1"
msgid "If you want that basalt eruption broken up, somebody get me a decent handle."
msgstr "要敲开喷发玄武岩的话，先给我拿把趁手的镐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_BASALT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_BASALT.2"
msgid "That basalt eruption looks like a job for a pickaxe."
msgstr "喷发玄武岩看起来得用镐来敲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_FLIPPABLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_FLIPPABLE.1"
msgid "Give me a hand turning it over. Let's see what's underneath."
msgstr "帮我翻一下。看看底下有什么。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_FLIPPABLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_FLIPPABLE.2"
msgid "I'll lift it. You deal with whatever runs out."
msgstr "我来掀。要有东西跑出来，你来管。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_HEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_HEAD.1"
msgid "I see the bfb. Think it's noticed me?"
msgstr "我看见友善的大鹏了。它注意到我了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_HEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_HEAD.2"
msgid "Nobody told me we'd be this close to a bfb."
msgstr "也没人告诉我会离友善的大鹏这么近。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_LEG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_LEG.1"
msgid "Keep an eye on the bfb. I don't like where it's standing."
msgstr "留意那边的友善的大鹏。它站的位置让我不放心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_LEG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_LEG.2"
msgid "Nobody told me we'd be this close to a bfb."
msgstr "也没人告诉我会离友善的大鹏这么近。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BRANCH1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BRANCH1.1"
msgid "Something about the weathered branch makes me want to look at the floor before I step."
msgstr "看见风化的树枝，我就觉得走路前得先看地上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BRANCH1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BRANCH1.2"
msgid "Take a look at the weathered branch. Tell me if anything around it moves."
msgstr "看看风化的树枝。旁边有东西动就告诉我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BRANCH2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BRANCH2.1"
msgid "I think I can see the weathered branch from here. Hold up the light."
msgstr "从这里好像能看到风化的树枝。把灯举高。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BRANCH2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BRANCH2.2"
msgid "Something about the weathered branch makes me want to look at the floor before I step."
msgstr "看见风化的树枝，我就觉得走路前得先看地上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BUSH.1"
msgid "I want a closer look at the weathered shrub. Can you watch my back?"
msgstr "我想凑近看看风化的灌木丛。帮我留意身后好吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BUSH.2"
msgid "I think I can see the weathered shrub from here. Hold up the light."
msgstr "从这里好像能看到风化的灌木丛。把灯举高。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_DEBRIS1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_DEBRIS1.1"
