msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_ROBIN_EGG.1"
msgid "Can we set the stone egg down somewhere it won't get knocked over?"
msgstr "能把岩蛋放在碰不倒的地方吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_ROBIN_EGG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_ROBIN_EGG.2"
msgid "Don't make me carry the stone egg all the way back here if you change your mind."
msgstr "你要是改主意，别让我把岩蛋再搬回来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_TAIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_TAIL.1"
msgid "A bfb. I'm giving it some room."
msgstr "是友善的大鹏。我先让它一点地方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_TAIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROC_TAIL.2"
msgid "I see the bfb. Think it's noticed me?"
msgstr "我看见友善的大鹏了。它注意到我了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOTTRUNK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOTTRUNK.1"
msgid "I could use the root trunk. Where are we putting it?"
msgstr "根箱能用得上。我们要放在哪儿？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOTTRUNK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOTTRUNK.2"
msgid "I'll dust the root trunk when I've got nothing else to do."
msgstr "等我实在没事可做了，再给根箱掸灰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROUND_DOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROUND_DOOR.1"
msgid "I keep forgetting which way the round doorway opens."
msgstr "我总记不住圆形的大门朝哪边开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROUND_DOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROUND_DOOR.2"
msgid "Leave the round doorway shut if you go out. I'm trying to keep it quiet in here."
msgstr "出去时把圆形的大门关上。我想让这里安静一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_GALLERY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_GALLERY.1"
msgid "If I lose you, meet me by the royal gallery exhibit."
msgstr "要是走散了，就在皇家画廊展柜旁边碰面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_GALLERY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_GALLERY.2"
msgid "I could wait by the royal gallery exhibit, if we're stopping here."
msgstr "如果要在这里停一会儿，我可以在皇家画廊展柜旁边等。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RO_BIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RO_BIN.1"
msgid "Look, a ro bin. Try not to scare it off."
msgstr "看，有露比。别把它吓跑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RO_BIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RO_BIN.2"
msgid "I'll leave the ro bin alone if it leaves me alone."
msgstr "只要露比不来打扰我，我也不去打扰它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RO_BIN_GIZZARD_STONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RO_BIN_GIZZARD_STONE.1"
msgid "I'll put the ro bin gizzard stone in my pocket. I can decide what to do with it later."
msgstr "露比的砂囊石先揣兜里。晚点再想怎么处理。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RO_BIN_GIZZARD_STONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RO_BIN_GIZZARD_STONE.2"
msgid "Someone kept this ro bin gizzard stone for a reason. I wonder why."
msgstr "有人特地留着这个露比的砂囊石。不知道为什么。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUG_BEARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUG_BEARD.1"
msgid "The beard rug is fine there. Please don't ask me to roll it up again."
msgstr "胡须地毯铺那儿就行。可别又让我卷起来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUG_BEARD.2
