msgstr "先把古代石地皮铺好，再把东西搬回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PIGRUINS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PIGRUINS.2"
msgid "The ancient stone turf can go here. I'm tired of carrying it."
msgstr "古代石地皮就铺这儿吧。我搬累了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PLAINS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PLAINS.1"
msgid "Let's lay the wild plains turf before putting all the furniture back."
msgstr "先把荒野平原地皮铺好，再把东西搬回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PLAINS.2
