msgstr "门口铺一条荒野平原地皮试试，看看效果。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RAINFOREST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RAINFOREST.1"
msgid "Try a strip of rainforest turf by the door. See how it looks."
msgstr "门口铺一条雨林地皮试试，看看效果。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RAINFOREST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RAINFOREST.2"
msgid "How much rainforest turf do we need to cover that patch?"
msgstr "铺满那一块要多少雨林地皮？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.DEAD.1"
msgid "It came right at me. What did it expect?"
msgstr "它都直接冲过来了。我还能怎么办？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.DEAD.2"
msgid "That bat's grounded. We can put the lights away."
msgstr "这只飞不起来了。灯可以收了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I like the kind of bat that stays in my hands."
msgstr "我比较喜欢能握在手里的那种球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Get away from my neck. You can bite a tree for all I care."
msgstr "离我脖子远点。要咬就去咬树。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "It finally stopped flapping. Let's go while it's still quiet."
msgstr "总算不扑腾了。趁它没醒快走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "How does it sleep upside down? I'd get a headache."
msgstr "倒挂着怎么睡？换我早就头疼了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBATCAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBATCAVE.1"
msgid "Don't stick your hand in the cave cleft. Something lives there."
msgstr "别把手伸进洞穴裂缝。里面住着东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBATCAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBATCAVE.2"
msgid "Keep quiet around the cave cleft. I don't want anything coming out."
msgstr "经过洞穴裂缝的时候小点声。我可不想把里面的东西引出来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIRE_BAT_WING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIRE_BAT_WING.1"
msgid "Sort the bat wing out from the rest of the pile for me, will you?"
msgstr "能帮我把蝙蝠翅膀从这堆东西里挑出来吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIRE_BAT_WING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIRE_BAT_WING.2"
msgid "I'll carry the bat wing if somebody else carries the rest."
msgstr "其他东西谁拿一下，蝙蝠翅膀我来带。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENOMGLAND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENOMGLAND.1"
msgid "Keep that venom gland. I might need it later."
msgstr "毒腺先留着。晚点我可能用得上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENOMGLAND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENOMGLAND.2"
msgid "I should make space in my bag for the venom gland."
msgstr "我应该在包里给毒腺腾点位置。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENUS_STALK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENUS_STALK.1"
msgid "If you're taking some flytrap stalk, leave a bit for later."
msgstr "要摘捕蝇草根的话，留点下次再来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENUS_STALK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENUS_STALK.2"
msgid "I wonder what the flytrap stalk looks like after a good rain."
msgstr "不知道下场雨以后，捕蝇草根会长成什么样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VINE.1"
msgid "I'll carry the vine if somebody else carries the rest."
msgstr "其他东西谁拿一下，藤蔓我来带。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VINE.2"
msgid "How much vine do we have now? I lost count."
msgstr "现在有多少藤蔓了？我数乱了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGSTICK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGSTICK.1"
msgid "If you borrow my stalking stick, put it back where you found it."
msgstr "借我的花茎手杖可以，用完放回原处。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGSTICK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGSTICK.2"
msgid "I'll take the stalking stick with me. Better than walking back for it."
msgstr "我把花茎手杖带上吧，省得走一半还得回来拿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALLCRACK_RUINS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALLCRACK_RUINS.1"
msgid "I think I can see the suspicious crack from here. Hold up the light."
msgstr "从这里好像能看到可疑的裂痕。把灯举高。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALLCRACK_RUINS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALLCRACK_RUINS.2"
msgid "I want a closer look at the suspicious crack. Can you watch my back?"
msgstr "我想凑近看看可疑的裂痕。帮我留意身后好吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_PIG_RUINS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_PIG_RUINS.1"
msgid "Sort the ancient wall out from the rest of the pile for me, will you?"
msgstr "能帮我把古代墙壁从这堆东西里挑出来吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_PIG_RUINS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_PIG_RUINS.2"
msgid "How much ancient wall do we have now? I lost count."
msgstr "现在有多少古代墙壁了？我数乱了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERDROP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERDROP.1"
msgid "I'll keep it till I know what to do with it. Try not to spill it."
msgstr "先留到弄清怎么用再说。别洒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERDROP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERDROP.2"
msgid "That's a drop of magic, apparently. Good thing I didn't wipe it up."
msgstr "说是滴魔法水。还好我没顺手擦掉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE.1"
msgid "Keep the weevole out of my bag. My lunch is in there."
msgstr "别让象鼻虫钻进我的包，午饭还在里面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE.2"
msgid "One's a nuisance. I hope that's all of them."
msgstr "一只就够烦了。希望只剩这一只。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE_CARAPACE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE_CARAPACE.1"
msgid "How much weevole carapace do we have now? I lost count."
msgstr "现在有多少象鼻鼠虫壳了？我数乱了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE_CARAPACE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE_CARAPACE.2"
msgid "Keep that weevole carapace. I might need it later."
msgstr "象鼻鼠虫壳先留着。晚点我可能用得上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHEELER_TRACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHEELER_TRACKER.1"
msgid "Somebody show me how the navigadget works. Keep it short."
msgstr "谁给我演示一下导向仪怎么用。简单说就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHEELER_TRACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHEELER_TRACKER.2"
msgid "Anybody using the navigadget? I could use a turn."
msgstr "有人在用导向仪吗？我正想用一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_GREENHOUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_GREENHOUSE.1"
msgid "Put a seat by the greenhouse wall. I'll tell you if anybody comes by."
msgstr "温室落地窗边上放张椅子吧。有人经过我就告诉你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_GREENHOUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_GREENHOUSE.2"
msgid "I can see out through the greenhouse wall without getting up. That's handy."
msgstr "不用站起来就能从温室落地窗看出去。挺方便。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE.1"
msgid "I think the square window needs a wipe. Or I just need glasses."
msgstr "方形窗户该擦了吧。也可能只是我得戴眼镜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE.2"
msgid "Put a seat by the square window. I'll tell you if anybody comes by."
msgstr "方形窗户边上放张椅子吧。有人经过我就告诉你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE_CURTAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE_CURTAIN.1"
msgid "Put a seat by the large square curtain window. I'll tell you if anybody comes by."
msgstr "大方形窗帘边上放张椅子吧。有人经过我就告诉你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE_CURTAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE_CURTAIN.2"
msgid "The large square curtain window gets enough light in the afternoon. Maybe too much."
msgstr "下午从大方形窗帘照进来的光够多了。甚至有点过头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND.1"
msgid "I can see out through the round window without getting up. That's handy."
msgstr "不用站起来就能从圆窗看出去。挺方便。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND.2"
msgid "Put a seat by the round window. I'll tell you if anybody comes by."
msgstr "圆窗边上放张椅子吧。有人经过我就告诉你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND_BURLAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND_BURLAP.1"
msgid "I can see out through the round burlap window without getting up. That's handy."
msgstr "不用站起来就能从麻布窗帘看出去。挺方便。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND_BURLAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND_BURLAP.2"
msgid "The round burlap window gets enough light in the afternoon. Maybe too much."
msgstr "下午从麻布窗帘照进来的光够多了。甚至有点过头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND_CURTAINS_NAILS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND_CURTAINS_NAILS.1"
msgid "I can see out through the round window without getting up. That's handy."
msgstr "不用站起来就能从圆形窗户看出去。挺方便。"

