msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_SMALL_PEAKED.1"
msgid "I think the peaked window needs a wipe. Or I just need glasses."
msgstr "椭圆拱窗该擦了吧。也可能只是我得戴眼镜。"

